	{ title = "The Crossroads", note = "Sergra by the inn first, then the innkeeper, Helbrim by the north gate, Thork and Darsok on the tower platform, Mankrik by the inn, and Tonga at the south gate last. His seed test waits for the Verog pass at the Stagnant Oasis: go straight on north-west to the Dry Hills. After the spores Helbrim offers Apothecary Zamah, a delivery to Thunder Bluff within 45 minutes: this route doesn't go there, so leave it (Druids take it on the next Crossroads stop, right before their flight to Thunder Bluff).", goals = {
