	{ title = "Raptor nests", note = "South-west from Ratchet across the plains to the Raptor Grounds: the three nests sit together south-west of the oasis, and Sunscale Scytheclaws guard them. Each nest needs a Sunscale Feather: kill Sunscale raptors (most drop one) until you have three, then use a feather at each nest.", goals = {
