	{ title = "Beren's Peril", note = "The Ravenclaw undead haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril, east of the road in the south-east of the forest; a Ravenclaw Guardian drops the Note Scrap that leads to the Offering Stone.\nAn elite spirit (20) often stands beside the Offering Stone: pull the Ravenclaws away from the stone before you fight them.", goals = {
