	{ title = "Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk", note = "These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk needs a group of 3. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.\nOverlord Mok'Morokk is elite: grouping up is advised. Beat him down until he gives up, then report to Draz'Zilb.", when = {{ k = "group", q = 1173 }}, goals = {
