	{ title = "OOX-09/HL", note = "Only with the distress beacon: the robot sits at the head of the river west of Skulk Rock. Escort it east to the shore beyond the Overlook Cliffs; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay.\nCareful: Two ambushes spawn during the escort: first three wildkin owlbeasts, then three trolls. Before each, the robot halts and announces it senses danger. Oozes, stealthed wolves and a large turtle along the path can join fights, and they respawn even if cleared beforehand.", goals = {
